    "title": "SCENE V. Capulet's Garden.",
    "location": "Capulet's Garden.",
    "orderInPlay": 10
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Juliet."
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "The clock struck nine when I did send the Nurse,",
          "plainText": "The clock struck nine when I did send the Nurse",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "In half an hour she promised to return.",
          "plainText": "In half an hour she promised to return",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Perchance she cannot meet him. That's not so.",
          "plainText": "Perchance she cannot meet him That's not so",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "O, she is lame. Love's heralds should be thoughts,",
          "plainText": "O she is lame Love's heralds should be thoughts",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Which ten times faster glides than the sun's beams,",
          "plainText": "Which ten times faster glides than the sun's beams",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Driving back shadows over lowering hills:",
          "plainText": "Driving back shadows over lowering hills",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Therefore do nimble-pinion'd doves draw love,",
          "plainText": "Therefore do nimblepinion'd doves draw love",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "And therefore hath the wind-swift Cupid wings.",
          "plainText": "And therefore hath the windswift Cupid wings",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Now is the sun upon the highmost hill",
          "plainText": "Now is the sun upon the highmost hill",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "Of this day's journey, and from nine till twelve",
          "plainText": "Of this day's journey and from nine till twelve",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "Is three long hours, yet she is not come.",
          "plainText": "Is three long hours yet she is not come",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "Had she affections and warm youthful blood,",
          "plainText": "Had she affections and warm youthful blood",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "She'd be as swift in motion as a ball;",
          "plainText": "She'd be as swift in motion as a ball",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "My words would bandy her to my sweet love,",
          "plainText": "My words would bandy her to my sweet love",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "And his to me.",
          "plainText": "And his to me",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "But old folks, many feign as they were dead;",
          "plainText": "But old folks many feign as they were dead",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "Unwieldy, slow, heavy and pale as lead.",
          "plainText": "Unwieldy slow heavy and pale as lead",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Nurse and Peter."
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Peter, stay at the gate.",
          "plainText": "Peter stay at the gate",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit Peter.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Now, good sweet Nurse,—O Lord, why look'st thou sad?",
          "plainText": "Now good sweet NurseO Lord why look'st thou sad",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Though news be sad, yet tell them merrily;",
          "plainText": "Though news be sad yet tell them merrily",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "If good, thou sham'st the music of sweet news",
          "plainText": "If good thou sham'st the music of sweet news",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "By playing it to me with so sour a face.",
          "plainText": "By playing it to me with so sour a face",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I am aweary, give me leave awhile;",
          "plainText": "I am aweary give me leave awhile",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Fie, how my bones ache! What a jaunt have I had!",
          "plainText": "Fie how my bones ache What a jaunt have I had",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I would thou hadst my bones, and I thy news:",
          "plainText": "I would thou hadst my bones and I thy news",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Nay come, I pray thee speak; good, good Nurse, speak.",
          "plainText": "Nay come I pray thee speak good good Nurse speak",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Jesu, what haste? Can you not stay a while? Do you not see that I am out of breath?",
          "plainText": "Jesu what haste Can you not stay a while Do you not see that I am out of breath",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How art thou out of breath, when thou hast breath",
          "plainText": "How art thou out of breath when thou hast breath",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "To say to me that thou art out of breath?",
          "plainText": "To say to me that thou art out of breath",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "The excuse that thou dost make in this delay",
          "plainText": "The excuse that thou dost make in this delay",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Is longer than the tale thou dost excuse.",
          "plainText": "Is longer than the tale thou dost excuse",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Is thy news good or bad? Answer to that;",
          "plainText": "Is thy news good or bad Answer to that",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Say either, and I'll stay the circumstance.",
          "plainText": "Say either and I'll stay the circumstance",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Let me be satisfied, is't good or bad?",
          "plainText": "Let me be satisfied is't good or bad",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Well, you have made a simple choice; you know not how to choose a man. Romeo? No, not he. Though his face be better than any man's, yet his leg excels all men's, and for a hand and a foot, and a body, though they be not to be talked on, yet they are past compare. He is not the flower of courtesy, but I'll warrant him as gentle as a lamb. Go thy ways, wench, serve God. What, have you dined at home?",
          "plainText": "Well you have made a simple choice you know not how to choose a man Romeo No not he Though his face be better than any man's yet his leg excels all men's and for a hand and a foot and a body though they be not to be talked on yet they are past compare He is not the flower of courtesy but I'll warrant him as gentle as a lamb Go thy ways wench serve God What have you dined at home",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, no. But all this did I know before.",
          "plainText": "No no But all this did I know before",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "What says he of our marriage? What of that?",
          "plainText": "What says he of our marriage What of that",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Lord, how my head aches! What a head have I!",
          "plainText": "Lord how my head aches What a head have I",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "It beats as it would fall in twenty pieces.",
          "plainText": "It beats as it would fall in twenty pieces",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "My back o' t'other side,—O my back, my back!",
          "plainText": "My back o' t'other sideO my back my back",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Beshrew your heart for sending me about",
          "plainText": "Beshrew your heart for sending me about",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "To catch my death with jauncing up and down.",
          "plainText": "To catch my death with jauncing up and down",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I'faith, I am sorry that thou art not well.",
          "plainText": "I'faith I am sorry that thou art not well",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Sweet, sweet, sweet Nurse, tell me, what says my love?",
          "plainText": "Sweet sweet sweet Nurse tell me what says my love",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Your love says like an honest gentleman,",
          "plainText": "Your love says like an honest gentleman",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "And a courteous, and a kind, and a handsome,",
          "plainText": "And a courteous and a kind and a handsome",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "And I warrant a virtuous,—Where is your mother?",
          "plainText": "And I warrant a virtuousWhere is your mother",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Where is my mother? Why, she is within.",
          "plainText": "Where is my mother Why she is within",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Where should she be? How oddly thou repliest.",
          "plainText": "Where should she be How oddly thou repliest",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "'Your love says, like an honest gentleman,",
          "plainText": "'Your love says like an honest gentleman",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "'Where is your mother?'",
          "plainText": "'Where is your mother'",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O God's lady dear,",
          "plainText": "O God's lady dear",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Are you so hot? Marry, come up, I trow.",
          "plainText": "Are you so hot Marry come up I trow",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Is this the poultice for my aching bones?",
          "plainText": "Is this the poultice for my aching bones",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Henceforward do your messages yourself.",
          "plainText": "Henceforward do your messages yourself",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Here's such a coil. Come, what says Romeo?",
          "plainText": "Here's such a coil Come what says Romeo",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0057",
          "number": 57,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Have you got leave to go to shrift today?",
          "plainText": "Have you got leave to go to shrift today",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0058",
          "number": 58,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I have.",
          "plainText": "I have",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-018",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "nurse",
        "name": "NURSE",
        "displayName": "Nurse"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0059",
          "number": 59,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Then hie you hence to Friar Lawrence' cell;",
          "plainText": "Then hie you hence to Friar Lawrence' cell",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0060",
          "number": 60,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "There stays a husband to make you a wife.",
          "plainText": "There stays a husband to make you a wife",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0061",
          "number": 61,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Now comes the wanton blood up in your cheeks,",
          "plainText": "Now comes the wanton blood up in your cheeks",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0062",
          "number": 62,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "They'll be in scarlet straight at any news.",
          "plainText": "They'll be in scarlet straight at any news",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0063",
          "number": 63,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Hie you to church. I must another way,",
          "plainText": "Hie you to church I must another way",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0064",
          "number": 64,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "To fetch a ladder by the which your love",
          "plainText": "To fetch a ladder by the which your love",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0065",
          "number": 65,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Must climb a bird's nest soon when it is dark.",
          "plainText": "Must climb a bird's nest soon when it is dark",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0066",
          "number": 66,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "I am the drudge, and toil in your delight;",
          "plainText": "I am the drudge and toil in your delight",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0067",
          "number": 67,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "But you shall bear the burden soon at night.",
          "plainText": "But you shall bear the burden soon at night",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0068",
          "number": 68,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "Go. I'll to dinner; hie you to the cell.",
          "plainText": "Go I'll to dinner hie you to the cell",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-speech-019",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "juliet",
        "name": "JULIET",
        "displayName": "Juliet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-line-0069",
          "number": 69,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Hie to high fortune! Honest Nurse, farewell.",
          "plainText": "Hie to high fortune Honest Nurse farewell",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet-2-5-stage-004",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}